(Mwancha Senior Community \(MSC\), founded in 2016 as Mwancha Home for the Elderly and legally) Tj
T* (registered under the Societies Act of Kenya, is dedicated to defending the dignity, health, and holistic) Tj
T* (wellbeing of vulnerable older persons in Kenya.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Through our community care center and network of 40 active ward-based volunteers across Nyamira and) Tj
T* (Kisii counties, MSC delivers compassionate home check-ins, medical escorts, emergency nutrition, and) Tj
T* (legal defense against elder abuse and property dispossession.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (For inquiries, partnerships, or academic citation permissions, please contact:) Tj
T* (Headquarters: Mwancha House - Ekerenyo, Ekerenyo-Obwari-Magwagwa Road, Nyamira North, Nyamira) Tj
T* (County, Kenya) Tj
T* (Postal Address: P.O. Box 162-40506 Ekerenyo-Nyamira, Kenya) Tj
T* (Email: mwachahomeforelderly@gmail.com / mwanchacommunity.seniors.com) Tj
T* (Website: https://mwancha.org) Tj
